id: pm-m6g87m
title: Declare item copy and workspace merge command destinations
description: "Disposition copy, merge, and item within the target noun grammar without feature loss, while separating item-level merge from the Git merge-driver namespace. Preserve every current spelling as an alias and record each destination in the generated command census."
