acceptance_criteria: "copy and item are placed under a declared noun with their capability unchanged; The merge name resolves its double duty explicitly: git integration versus item-level merge is disambiguated in the grammar and in the ADR, or one of the two is renamed with an alias; The disposition of each is recorded in the destination table from the census task"
