confidence: medium
resolution: "Item copy and Git merge-driver operations have declared SDK-owned destinations, permanent compatibility aliases, longest-prefix parsing, and preserved handler semantics."
expected_result: Copy and Git merge-driver operations retain all capabilities under unambiguous command paths.
actual_result: "Temporary-project copy, duplicate child reparenting, strict history verification, Git driver installation/report, package consumers, and full regression gates passed."
