comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-10T04:18:53.738Z","harness:codex","Design: item is already the accepted noun for structured mutation and completion/reopen. Relocate copy to item copy and Git merge-driver operations to workspace merge. Item duplicate reconciliation is explicitly item duplicates merge, separating item semantics from Git driver install/status/driver/reconcile behavior. Keep all published spellings as hidden aliases. No new tracker items were created."
  "2026-09-10T05:13:40.465Z","harness:codex","Verification: real isolated tracker copy, duplicate preview and apply, child reparenting, terminal duplicate state, strict history verification, literal search escape, and workspace merge driver installation/report all passed. Real Fish execution caught and fixed nested suggestion quoting. The static gate preserves its existing ceilings and currently identifies a contract-discovery token overrun for investigation."
  "2026-09-10T05:37:54.656Z","harness:codex","Candidate acceptance: a packed build installs in isolated npm and Bun consumers; both exercise create, item copy, installed item duplicates merge discovery, and search advanced keyword queries successfully. npx and bunx execute the same candidate tarball successfully. Earlier temporary-workspace acceptance verified duplicate consolidation re-parenting and closure, strict hash chains, literal search operands, and workspace merge driver installation. No production tracker was used by acceptance tests."
  "2026-09-10T06:17:53.732Z","harness:codex","Final verification: 660 test files and 8680 tests pass. Exact coverage is statements 63924/63924, branches 48623/48623, functions 13290/13290, lines 61268/61268. Source/export/member docstrings are 100 percent. TypeScript, ESLint, zero-clone jscpd, static structure, SDK/command/flag parity, refusal recovery, token budgets, graph composition, record integrity, credential scan, and linked tests passed. Manual temporary-project acceptance and packed npm/Bun/npx/bunx consumers passed. The independent public verifier confirms published 2026.9.9; this implementation is pending PR review and merge. GitHub currently has zero open PRs/issues and zero open dependency/code/secret alerts."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-10T06:06:46.184Z","harness:codex","Namespace registration is two-phase: relocate core parents before installing package facets, then relocate remaining leaves after registration. Preserve the Commander handler object and resolve the longest declared SDK prefix so three-token commands retain their flags and stable operation identities."
